GET http://localhost:8668/v2/entities/urn:ngsi-ld:air-quality-station:AQS001 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
fiware-service: smartcity
fiware-servicepath: /



### quantumLeap - Query distoric data for attribute

GET http://localhost:8668/v2/entities/urn:ngsi-ld:air-quality-station:AQS001/attrs/carbonDioxide HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
fiware-service: smartcity
fiware-servicepath: /